#v(20pt)
#only("4-")[- Assumes rational investor behavior 🧠]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("The Efficient Market Hypothesis is a key concept in Traditional Finance that is based on the assumption of investor rationality.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("According to this hypothesis, market prices reflect all available information, and it is not possible to consistently achieve returns in excess of average market returns.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("If markets are efficient and prices reflect all information, investors cannot consistently outperform the market.")
]
#only("4")[
#voiceover("The Efficient Market Hypothesis relies on the assumption that investors behave rationally and make decisions based on available information.")
]
]

